================================================================================

The RyuLdn client (runtime/net/ryuldn.c) and the room client (runtime/net/room.c) were written from the protocols: Ryujinx's
LdnServer and LDN client (MIT License, Copyright (c) Ryujinx Team and Contributors) and the suyu / yuzu / Citra room protocol.

The two embedded servers are the project author's own code. runtime/net/ryusrv/ (the Ryujinx LDN server) follows the behaviour
of Ryujinx's LdnServer (MIT, Copyright (c) Ryujinx Team and Contributors); runtime/net/roomsrv.c (the room) is written from the
room protocol as the suyu / yuzu / Citra members speak it and contains no code of those projects.


